I don't list all the possible ways (because I don't have a list handy),
but since you said you are a newbie, I suspect the most likely reason your
strength has dropped is poisonous food. 
(Killer bee corpses, for example. There are also some other poisonous
corpses, but killer bees are very common.)

One way to get back strength lost that way is a unicorn horn, as was
mentioned. Once you get one of those.
And after you get poison resistance, you can safely eat most corpses that
otherwise would lower your strength.

